{
  "$schema": "https://json.schemastore.org/claude-code-settings.json",
  "agentPushNotifEnabled": true,
  "attribution": {
    "commit": "",
    "pr": ""
  },
  "autoDreamEnabled": false,
  "autoMemoryEnabled": true,
  "autoMode": {
    "allow": [
      "$defaults"
    ],
    "environment": [
      "### Org-wide",
      "**Organization**: None configured",
      "**Cloud provider(s)**: None configured",
      "**Repository visibility**: varies per repo — confirm with gh for the specific repo rather than assuming either way",
      "**Internal sharing / snippet hosting**: None configured. Never publish or upload anything to a public destination — gists, pastebins, third-party paste services, or Claude Artifacts.",
      "**Secrets management**: None configured. Credentials are never pasted into chat or a transcript and never committed.",
      "**Default / protected branches**: None configured",
      "**CI/CD deploy targets**: None configured",
      "**Network posture**: None configured",
      "**Source control**: None configured",
      "**Trusted internal domains**: None configured",
      "**Trusted cloud buckets**: None configured",
      "**Key internal services**: None configured",
      "**Internal package registry**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive data locations & audiences**: never commit or publish credentials — a repo being private does not make them safe to commit",
      "**Data retention / declassification**: some repos are local-by-default and publish only an explicitly promoted subdirectory — read the repo's own CLAUDE.md for its rule, and never bypass .gitignore with git add -f",
      "**Sensitive remote targets**: any namespace, host, or container whose name carries prod or production as a whole word or name segment",
      "**Protected deployment namespaces / environments**: None configured — fall back to the Sensitive remote targets heuristic",
      "**Protected IaC scopes**: IAM, RBAC, networking, quota, and node-pool resources; anything whose name or tag carries prod or production as a whole word or name segment",
      "### User-specific",
      "**Primary use of Claude Code**: None configured",
      "**Trusted repo**: the repo the session started in. Other repos on disk are out of scope unless the user names them.",
      "**Org-specific CLIs**: None configured",
      "**Routine promotion**: in repos that are local-by-default, moving a file into the repo's tracked or published directory is the documented, deliberate publication step — treat it as routine rather than as accidental exposure, subject to the never-promote exclusions above"
    ]
  },
  "cleanupPeriodDays": 36500,
  "effortLevel": "medium",
  "enabledPlugins": {
    "art@skills-dir": false,
    "clangd-lsp@claude-plugins-official": true,
    "gamedev-genres@skills-dir": false,
    "gamedev-publish@skills-dir": false,
    "gamedev@skills-dir": false,
    "gsap@skills-dir": false,
    "hyperframes@skills-dir": false,
    "interface-imagegen@skills-dir": false,
    "interface-styles@skills-dir": false,
    "interface-tools@skills-dir": false,
    "interface@skills-dir": false,
    "motion@skills-dir": false,
    "react@skills-dir": false,
